WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.314
Week 14: Travel, Transport, and Lodging. reserve transport and lodging check in report delays and room problems

2
00:00:08.314 --> 00:00:29.500
Read for the situation. El vuelo de Omar llega tarde y pierde el último autobús. Llama al hotel para mantener la reserva y pregunta cómo llegar en transporte compartido. Omar's flight arrives late, and he misses the last bus. He calls the hotel to keep the reservation and asks how to get there using shared transportation.

3
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:38.390
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:45.936
Reading activities. Reading activity 32; Reading activity 33; Reading activity 34

5
00:00:45.936 --> 00:00:54.122
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:54.122 --> 00:01:20.252
Model language. El tren sale del andén cuatro. — The train leaves from platform four. Acabamos de llegar al aeropuerto. — We have just arrived at the airport. Tengo una reserva a nombre de Rivera. — I have a reservation under the name Rivera. Mi equipaje no aparece. — My luggage is missing. Vamos a quedarnos tres noches. — We are going to stay three nights.

7
00:01:20.252 --> 00:01:30.257
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
